# Motion

Read `.cursor/skills/databricks-visual-language/motion.md`.

```css
--ease-standard: cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
--ease-emphasized: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
--motion-fast: 150ms;    /* hover color, focus */
--motion-standard: 240ms; /* card lift, tab crossfade */
--motion-slow: 320ms;     /* section reveal, mockup */
```

- One scroll reveal per section (24px fade-up, stagger children 80ms). Not every card independently.
- Lava button hover = `brightness(1.08)`, not a color swap. Cards lift `translateY(-2px)`.
- Diagrams: dashoffset flow and/or a token on `offset-path` (8–12s). Pause off-screen; provide a pause control for looping decoration.
- No bounce, spring, `transition: all`, or pulsing CTAs.
- `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce`: freeze diagrams at a complete rest pose; opacity-only ~100ms; no parallax or hover lift.
